B.aw1=new A.fL("How do I pay my fees?","Tap Pay now in Tuition Fee to open Razorpay\u2019s secure checkout. If the app says checkout is available in the web portal, sign in to the SuperCampus web portal in a browser and pay there.")
B.avV=new A.fL("Where are my receipts?","In Tuition Fee under Payment history & receipts. Tap the download icon next to a payment to save its receipt.")
B.aw8=new A.fL("An amount, fine or waiver looks wrong.","Fees, fines and waivers are set by your institution. Ask via the form below and choose Fees & payments.")
B.bAT=s([B.avQ,B.aw1,B.avV,B.aw8],t.KK)
B.awj=new A.t6("Fees & payments",B.bAT)
B.avR=new A.fL("How do I get my meal pass?","Open Hostel \u2192 Mess & meals. Each meal has its own QR pass: tap Show and present it at the mess. A pass is marked Used or Expired afterwards.")
B.aw0=new A.fL("Why can\u2019t I see any meal passes?","Meal passes appear once your hostel fee has been marked paid; until then you\u2019ll see that payment verification is pending. Meal passes are for hostellers only. Meal times and whether the mess is open are set by your institution.")
B.awd=new A.fL("How do I report a problem in my room?","Open Hostel \u2192 Report an issue. From the hostel home you can also request a room change, register visitors, or start vacating.")
B.bge=s([B.avR,B.aw0,B.awd],t.KK)
B.awi=new A.t6("Hostel & mess",B.bge)
B.awb=new A.fL("How do I request a pass?","Open Gatepass. Everyone can Apply leave pass; hostellers can also Apply outpass. Fill in the details and tap Submit for approval.")
B.avU=new A.fL("Who approves my request?","It depends on your institution \u2014 a request can need parent, warden, advisor/HOD or principal approval. Gatepass shows its status, and you can cancel it while it is still pending.")
B.awe=new A.fL("How do I use an approved pass at the gate?","Show the pass QR to security. If it can\u2019t be scanned, read out the six-digit code shown under the QR.")
B.aw7=new A.fL("Why does my daily gate QR say it has expired?","The daily Gate-in QR only works inside the campus boundary. Turn on location and open it again when you are on campus.")
B.buw=s([B.awb,B.avU,B.awe,B.aw7],t.KK)
B.awk=new A.t6("Gatepass",B.buw)
B.avX=new A.fL("How do I borrow a book?","Open Library, find the book and send a borrow request. It waits for the librarian\u2019s approval, then shows its due date under My borrowed books.")
B.avZ=new A.fL("Can I renew a book?","Renew appears on an approved loan that isn\u2019t overdue. Overdue loans show the days late and any fine.")
B.avY=new A.fL("How do I book a visit slot?","Tap Book a visit slot, pick a date and time, then Confirm Booking. Show its QR at the library to check in; you can also cancel or check out early.")
B.bfN=s([B.avX,B.avZ,B.avY],t.KK)
B.awl=new A.t6("Library",B.bfN)
B.aw6=new A.fL("Where can I see my attendance?","Open Academics. Overall attendance counts present, absent, OD and leave. Attendance history shows each day on a calendar \u2014 tap a day for the subject, staff and period.")
B.avP=new A.fL("Where are my marks and timetable?","In Academics: Marks and results groups semester examinations, internal assessments and other tests, and Class Timetable shows your weekly schedule. \u201cNo marks published yet\u201d means your department hasn\u2019t released them.")
B.aw2=new A.fL("My attendance or marks look wrong.","These are recorded by your faculty. Ask via the form below and choose Attendance, marks & timetable.")
B.bfL=s([B.aw6,B.avP,B.aw2],t.KK)
B.awf=new A.t6("Attendance, marks & timetable",B.bfL)
B.aw3=new A.fL("Why do I have more than one wallet balance?","Each shop \u2014 canteen, stationery, laundry \u2014 keeps its own wallet balance, and orders are paid from that shop\u2019s wallet.")
B.aw_=new A.fL("How do I add money to my wallet?","Tap Top up in the shop\u2019s wallet. If online top-up isn\u2019t available, ask your institution\u2019s accounts office to credit your wallet.")
B.avT=new A.fL("What is the transaction PIN?","A 4-digit PIN that approves wallet payments. You create it the first time you pay, or in Settings \u2192 Transaction PIN.")
B.avS=new A.fL("I forgot my transaction PIN.","Go to Settings \u2192 Transaction PIN and verify with your account password \u2014 or your recovery word, if you set one \u2014 then choose a new PIN.")
B.avW=new A.fL("Where do I collect my order?","After paying, show the order\u2019s QR at the counter.")
B.buL=s([B.aw3,B.aw_,B.avT,B.avS,B.avW],t.KK)
B.awh=new A.t6("Canteen, wallet & PIN",B.buL)
B.awa=new A.fL("I forgot my password.","On the sign-in screen tap Forgot password? to get a reset link by email. If you are signed in, go to Settings \u2192 Password \u2192 Forgot your current password?")
B.aw9=new A.fL("How do I change my password?","Settings \u2192 Password. Enter your current password, then the new one twice.")
B.awc=new A.fL("How do I change my photo or name?","Your photo and profile details are managed by your institution. Ask via the form below to have them corrected.")
B.aw5=new A.fL("How do I switch to dark mode?","Settings \u2192 Appearance, then choose Light, Dark or System.")
B.aw4=new A.fL("Where are my notifications?","Tap Alerts. Mark all as read clears the list.")
B.br3=s([B.awa,B.aw9,B.awc,B.aw5,B.aw4],t.KK)
B.awg=new A.t6("Account & app",B.br3)
B.btI=s([B.awj,B.awi,B.awk,B.awl,B.awf,B.awh,B.awg],A.ap("D<t6>"))
